Note:
Parts of this program were written with the help of AI based tools, such as chat
bots or local coding assistants, particularly during early prototyping. Where
significant parts of the code were written by AI based tools, it is explicitly
indicated in the corresponding Git commit message by a Co-developed-by tag.

AI usage policy:
The use of AI based tools is accepted, but all submitted code must be *fully
understood and verified* by the human submitting it. The human submitting the
code is ultimately responsible for the submission.
